 "intro_zh": "多少年以来，埃塞俄比亚高原遭受了严重侵蚀，但侵蚀也造就了世界上最为壮观的奇景之一，这里山峰险峻，峡谷幽深，悬崖峭壁高达1500米。公园也是一些极珍稀动物的栖息地，比如杰拉达狒狒、塞米恩狐狸和世界上仅此一处的瓦利亚野生山羊。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "Massive erosion over the years on the Ethiopian plateau has created one of the most spectacular landscapes in the world, with jagged mountain peaks, deep valleys and sharp precipices dropping some 1,500 m. The park is home to some extremely rare animals such as the Gelada baboon, the Simien fox and the Walia ibex, a goat found nowhere else in the world.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_local": "",
 "intro_local_source": null,
